sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant D as Device (PWA)
  participant L as Local encrypted store
  participant Q as Sync queue (outbox)
  participant API as API gateway
  participant S as Sync service
  participant DB as Server database

  D->>L: save record (client UUID, device id, client time)
  L->>Q: enqueue change (idempotency key, base version)
  Note over Q: survives restart and reboot
  Q->>API: POST change (token, key, device id)
  alt network drops before response
    API--xQ: no response
    Q->>Q: backoff with jitter, retry later
    Q->>API: same request, same key
    API->>S: duplicate key
    S-->>Q: original result (no second record)
  else server unavailable (5xx / 429)
    API-->>Q: error
    Q->>Q: backoff with jitter, stay queued
  else validation or permission rejected (4xx)
    API-->>Q: rejected with reason
    Q->>L: mark rejected, keep copy, show to user
  else accepted
    API->>S: apply change
    S->>DB: insert / update with server time, new version
    alt base version matches
      DB-->>S: committed
      S-->>API: ack (server id, server time, version)
      API-->>Q: ack
      Q->>L: update local copy, mark synced
    else base version is stale (another device changed it)
      S->>S: conflict rules by field type
      S-->>API: conflict + server copy
      API-->>Q: conflict
      Q->>L: keep both, show resolution if manual
    end
  end
  Note over D,API: device revoked or token expired: queue pauses, data stays encrypted, re-authenticate
